{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s21-p01",
      "text": "You are always told to wash your hands before dining.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p02",
      "text": "You know you must wash your hands after going to the bathroom or touching a litter bin.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p03",
      "text": "Do you know how to wash your hands correctly to keep away from germs and flu virus?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p04",
      "text": "Always use soap to wash your hands.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p05",
      "text": "After turning on the tap and wetting your hands, you can rub your hands with soap.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p06",
      "text": "Soap may not kill all the germs, but it can wash away the grease on your skin.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p07",
      "text": "As the grease is washed away, the germs will leave your hands and go away.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p08",
      "text": "You should wash your hands for 15-20 seconds.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p09",
      "text": "How do you know the length of 15-20 seconds?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p10",
      "text": "You can sing ABC Song.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p11",
      "text": "By the time you get to the last note, your hands will be clean.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p12",
      "text": "Then you can pull your hands out from under the tap.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p13",
      "text": "Rub your hands together.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p14",
      "text": "You can use one hand to rub the back of the other hand and then exchange two hands to repeat this.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p15",
      "text": "You also need to rub between your fingers.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p16",
      "text": "Don't forget to rub under and around your fingernails.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p17",
      "text": "Maybe your hands don't look dirty, but there are germs on them.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p18",
      "text": "Germs are too small for you to see.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p19",
      "text": "They are on your hands all the time.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p20",
      "text": "Many illnesses are caused by germs.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21-p21",
      "text": "Therefore, wash your hands carefully before enjoying your strawberries, pancakes or potato salad!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p21.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
